# Assignment and printable-document quality

When work creates, adapts, audits, or renders an assignment, workbook, evidence
pack, PDF, or printable document, read and follow the canonical policy in
`config/agent-rules/assignment-document-quality.md`.

Do not claim completion or Confidence above 8 until content completeness,
reference parity, generated-image inspection, and rendered-output verification
all have receipts.
